  {
   "id": "resetna-314195@major-2025-03-13",
   "gameId": "resetna-314195",
   "displayName": "ReSetna major update - RUBY ARMOR UPGRADE",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-13T17:04:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "After 12 updates in just a month, ReSetna is completely overhauled based on YOUR feedback.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We were in constant communication with our players to give you the game you deserve! Every single review and suggestion made it into our development backlog.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are introducing the most powerful update of ReSetna yet - RUBY ARMOR UPGRADE",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new armor isn’t just a visual upgrade, it is a synonym for more combat-ready ReSetna! Now, with reworked combat, improved controls and ReSetna upgraded systems, the fight against the Signal is more intense and thrilling than before.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Visual & Environment Upgrades",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Resetna is now playable with a new \"Ruby Armor\" skin. This option can be toggled through the Character menu if you wish to return to default skin",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Environment revamp with new visual effects and background elements, backed up with new, immersive sound effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The final boss fight is now conceptually better with a brand new cut scene before the start of the fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New UI effects that enhance the player's experience and reduce previous confusion",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Combat upgrades",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "All weapons are now improved, more responsive and enjoyable: animations and combos have been re-made and optimized for player's experience",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Axe combo now has a faster, more responsive chain of attacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sabre's attacks are now much more enjoyable and responsive with new animations along with its parry-counterattack and in-air attacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Naginata has also been reworked making the weapon feel more impactful, heavier, along with new parry-counterattack and in-air attacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Laser projectiles from most basic enemies are now reflectable - the player is now able to avoid annoying ranged attacks, reflect them and still do a strong parry-counterattack while doing that",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Other changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Key rebinding, a very much requested feature, is finally here. Players will now be able to customize their input keys, as well as choose from presets when playing on controllers",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Side quests now feel more useful, giving rewards and upgrades, making exploration worthwhile: Settings user experience has been improved by adding an \"Apply changes\" key to avoid setting application at each change",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Developer's note\" window has been added to notify our players of what changes we've made: How to get the Update: The RUBY ARMOR UPGRADE is a free, automatic download that will be available once you visit our game page on Steam.: You may need to restart your Steam client to initiate the download.: The complete Patch Notes are available in our official Discord, where you can join a community of other ReSetna players.: In case of any bugs, please send us details with screenshots, videos or player log file to developer@tgdevs.com and we will respond promptly - as always :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Player log file is on your PC, and you can access it here",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "AppData/LocalLow/Today's Games/ReSetna",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Player.log file",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Closing Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you will enjoy these latest improvements!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, we’re listening to your feedback and working to refine ReSetna further.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any feedback or suggestions for us, let us know on our Discord.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are always there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more updates, and thank you for being part of our journey!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "--",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord: https://discord.gg/r7paMbkVvD",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "X: @tgdevs_official",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
